 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + All jurors selected for Panel B\, State of Maine VS. Leigh Cote\, ple
 ase report to the Capital Judicial Center at 8:30 AM on Thursday\, October
  29\, 2026. Thank you and have a pleasant evening.\n  + Somerset County Su
 perior Court - Skowhegan\n  + The following Jurors need to report for Jury
  Duty on Thursday\, October 29th\, 2026\, at 8:30 am. : 1\, 2\, 3\, 7\, 8\
 , 10\, 12\, 16\, 17\, 20\, 22\, 24\, 30\, 31\, 32\, 33\, 38\, 41\, 43\, 44
 \, 51\, 54\, 56\, 57\, 58\, 59\, 63\, 68\, 72\, 73\, 76\, 79\, 81\, 82\, 8
 4\, 86\, 89\, 90\, 93\, 94\, 95\, 98\, 100\, 103\, 105\, 111\, 113\, 118\,
  120\, 122\, 123\, 125\, 129\, 130\, 132\, 136\, 137\, 138\, 139\, 145\, 1
 47\, 152\, 154\, 155\, 157\, 163\, 165\, 166\, 167\, 168\, 171\, 172\, 173
 \, 175\, 176\, 178\, 180\, 186\, 187\, 188\, 189\, 190\, 191\, 192\, 198\,
  199\, 200\, 205\, 213\, 214\, 215\, 217\, 219.\n  + You can park in the S
 kowhegan District Court\, Somerset Superior Court\, or the municipal parki
 ng lot. PLEASE DO NOT park directly across from the Somerset Superior Cour
 t building. Thank you.\n  + PLEASE CHECK BACK HERE FOR ANY UPDATES TO THE 
 ABOVE or CALL 1-800-872-5539 AFTER 6 PM THE NIGHT BEFORE YOU WERE TOLD TO 
 REPORT.\n  + IF THE COURT NEEDS TO CLOSE DUE TO INCLEMENT WEATHER A MESSAG
 E WILL BE PLACED AFTER 7:00 A.M\n  + PROHIBITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Pl
 ease be advised that pursuant to Administrative Order JB-20-01\, use of el
 ectronic devices during trial or while in deliberations are prohibited and
  all devices will need to be temporarily surrendered. During jury selectio
 n\, all devices must be turned off.\n  + October 2\n[diff truncated]\nhttp
 s://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
